"STORIES": "\n    <div class=\"stories__col\" data-speed=\"-6\">\n      <figure class=\"qcard\"><svg class=\"ico qcard__mark\"><use href=\"#i-quote\"/></svg><blockquote>\"My son has gotten the Visa for his higher studies in one of the reputed American institutions. Despite his complicated profile, the team made this happen.\"</blockquote><figcaption><span class=\"avatar\">RS</span><span><strong>Ramana S.</strong><small>Parent of Student, USA</small></span></figcaption></figure>\n      <figure class=\"qcard qcard--accent\"><svg class=\"ico qcard__mark\"><use href=\"#i-quote\"/></svg><blockquote>\"I had a previous visa rejection and was losing hope. My Tutee Connect coordinator completely turned it around and guided me through the entire documentation process successfully.\"</blockquote><figcaption><span class=\"avatar\">SR</span><span><strong>Sneha R.</strong><small>Graduate Student, California</small></span></figcaption></figure>\n      <figure class=\"qcard\"><svg class=\"ico qcard__mark\"><use href=\"#i-quote\"/></svg><blockquote>\"The comprehensive counseling at Tutee Connect opened my eyes to universities I hadn't even considered. Now I'm loving my semester in Michigan!\"</blockquote><figcaption><span class=\"avatar\">KN</span><span><strong>Karthik N.</strong><small>CS Major, Michigan</small></span></figcaption></figure>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"stories__col\" data-speed=\"8\">\n      <figure class=\"qcard qcard--light\"><svg class=\"ico qcard__mark\"><use href=\"#i-quote\"/></svg><blockquote>\"Tutee Connect helped me perfectly transition my mock interviews, and thanks to them my F1 visa was approved in the very first attempt!\"</blockquote><figcaption><span class=\"avatar\">PK</span><span><strong>Priya K.</strong><small>Masters Student, New York</small></span></figcaption></figure>\n      <figure class=\"qcard\"><svg class=\"ico qcard__mark\"><use href=\"#i-quote\"/></svg><blockquote>\"The non-collateral education loan assistance is 100% genuine. They connected me directly with their banking partners and got my financials sorted in record time.\"</blockquote><figcaption><span class=\"avatar\">RV</span><span><strong>Rahul V.</strong><small>Engineering Major, Illinois</small></span></figcaption></figure>\n      <figure class=\"qcard qcard--accent\"><svg class=\"ico qcard__mark\"><use href=\"#i-quote\"/></svg><blockquote>\"From application essays to final visa prep, the entire journey felt so personalized. Highly recommended for anyone aiming for the US.\"</blockquote><figcaption><span class=\"avatar\">DP</span><span><strong>Divya P.</strong><small>Data Science, Washington</small></span></figcaption></figure>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"stories__col\" data-speed=\"-10\">\n      <figure class=\"qcard\"><svg class=\"ico qcard__mark\"><use href=\"#i-quote\"/></svg><blockquote>\"They didn't just help with the admission. The post-landing support for getting my accommodation in Texas was a lifesaver.\"</blockquote><figcaption><span class=\"avatar\">VM</span><span><strong>Vishal M.</strong><small>Undergrad, Texas</small></span></figcaption></figure>\n      <figure class=\"qcard qcard--light\"><svg class=\"ico qcard__mark\"><use href=\"#i-quote\"/></svg><blockquote>\"Beyond just the F1 visa, their career consultation for OPT and future H1B pathways gave me the exact clarity I needed before flying out.\"</blockquote><figcaption><span class=\"avatar\">AD</span><span><strong>Anita D.</strong><small>MBA Candidate, Mass.</small></span></figcaption></figure>\n      <figure class=\"qcard\"><svg class=\"ico qcard__mark\"><use href=\"#i-quote\"/></svg><blockquote>\"Securing a graduate assistantship felt impossible, but with their profile building strategies, I actually got a full tuition waiver!\"</blockquote><figcaption><span class=\"avatar\">SJ</span><span><strong>Siddharth J.</strong><small>PhD Student, Ohio</small></span></figcaption></figure>\n    </div>\n",
"FAQ": "\n      <details class=\"qa\" open><summary><span>What are the basic requirements to study in the USA?</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></summary><div class=\"qa__a\"><p>Generally, you need a valid passport, strong academic transcripts, standardized test scores (like TOEFL/IELTS for English proficiency, and GRE/GMAT for graduates), letters of recommendation (LORs), and a compelling Statement of Purpose (SOP).</p></div></details>\n      <details class=\"qa\"><summary><span>How does the F1 Student Visa process work?</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></summary><div class=\"qa__a\"><p>After receiving an acceptance letter and an I-20 form from a US university, you must pay the SEVIS fee, complete the DS-160 visa application online, and schedule a visa interview at the nearest US Embassy or Consulate. We provide comprehensive guidance for every step, including mock interviews.</p></div></details>\n      <details class=\"qa\"><summary><span>Can I get financial aid or an education loan?</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></summary><div class=\"qa__a\"><p>Yes! We have exclusive tie-ups with top financial institutions and banks to provide both collateral and non-collateral education loans. These loans can cover your tuition fees, accommodation, and living expenses with competitive interest rates.</p></div></details>\n      <details class=\"qa\"><summary><span>Can my family relocate with me to the USA?</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></summary><div class=\"qa__a\"><p>Absolutely. Your spouse and unmarried children under the age of 21 can accompany you on an F-2 dependent visa while you study. If you later transition to an H-1B work visa, they can stay with you on an H-4 visa.</p></div></details>\n      <details class=\"qa\"><summary><span>What is OPT and how long can I work after graduation?</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></summary><div class=\"qa__a\"><p>Optional Practical Training (OPT) allows international students to work in the US for up to 12 months in a field related to their study. If you graduate with a STEM degree, you are eligible for an additional 24-month OPT extension, giving you up to 3 years of work authorization.</p></div></details>\n      <details class=\"qa\"><summary><span>Do you help with accommodation and pre-departure?</span><i aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></summary><div class=\"qa__a\"><p>Yes, we partner with top student housing providers to secure safe and comfortable living spaces near your campus. We also conduct comprehensive pre-departure briefings covering US culture, academic expectations, packing lists, and immigration procedures.</p></div></details>\n",
"MILESTONES": "<ol class=\"route__steps\">\n          <li class=\"milestone\" data-milestone><span class=\"milestone__no\">01</span><div><h4>F-1 Student Visa</h4><p>Complete your study program. We ensure you pick STEM courses for a 3-year OPT extension.</p></div></li>\n          <li class=\"milestone\" data-milestone><span class=\"milestone__no\">02</span><div><h4>OPT &amp; Employment</h4><p>Secure employment in the US. Work legally for up to 3 years and gain invaluable corporate experience.</p></div></li>\n          <li class=\"milestone\" data-milestone><span class=\"milestone__no\">03</span><div><h4>H-1B Work Visa</h4><p>Transition smoothly with our guidance to an employer-sponsored H-1B visa for long-term work.</p></div></li>\n          <li class=\"milestone\" data-milestone><span class=\"milestone__no\">04</span><div><h4>Permanent Residency</h4><p>Take the final step towards settlement via Employment-Based (EB) Green Card sponsorship.</p></div></li>\n        </ol>",
"FAMILY_LIST": "<ul class=\"family__list\">\n        <li data-reveal><span class=\"tick\"><svg class=\"ico\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg></span><p><strong>F-2 Visa:</strong> For dependents of F-1 students. Children can attend K-12 schools.</p></li>\n        <li data-reveal><span class=\"tick\"><svg class=\"ico\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg></span><p><strong>H-4 Visa:</strong> For dependents of H-1B workers. Spouses may be eligible for work authorization (EAD).</p></li>\n        <li data-reveal><span class=\"tick\"><svg class=\"ico\"><use href=\"#i-check\"/></svg></span><p><strong>Expert Guidance:</strong> We assist with dependent visa applications, documentation, and interview prep.</p></li>\n      </ul>",
